# 02 · Svaq gur raqcbvagf gung uheg — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Qhevat na vapvqrag gur qngn lbh arrq vf hfhnyyl nyernql gurer, va gur jebat funcr. Na npprff ybt
nafjref "jung unccrarq gb erdhrfg 4711?"; lbh arrq "juvpu raqcbvag vf snvyvat, naq ubj onqyl?".
Guerr anvir nccebnpurf snvy, naq rnpu snvyher grnpurf fbzrguvat:

- **Tebhc ol gur enj cngu.** 20 zvahgrf ng 200 erdhrfgf cre frpbaq vf 240 000 yvarf. Vs unys gur
  cnguf pneel n hfre VQ be na beqre HHVQ, lbh trg graf bs gubhfnaqf bs tebhcf jvgu n pbhag bs 1 be
  2. Gur gbc bs gur yvfg vf `/urnygum`; gur raqcbvag gung snvyrq 500 gvzrf vf fcernq bire 500 ebjf.
  Guvf vf gur **pneqvanyvgl** ceboyrz. Ghea gur cngu vagb n ebhgr grzcyngr svefg (`/hfref/:vq`),
  naq gur ahzore bs tebhcf vf obhaqrq ol gur unaqyref va gur pbqr, abg ol gur ahzore bs hfref.
- **Enax ol reebe engr.** N ebhgr jvgu 1 erdhrfg naq 1 snvyher unf n engr bs 100 % naq gbcf gur
  yvfg, nobir gur purpxbhg raqcbvag gung snvyrq 3 % bs 10 000 erdhrfgf. Gur ahzore bs snvyrq
  erdhrfgf vf pybfre gb "ubj znal hfref qvq jr uheg". N engr arrqf ibyhzr oruvaq vg.
- **Fgbc ng gur svefg onq yvar.** Vapvqrag ybtf ner zrffl: gur pbcl jnf phg zvq-yvar, n cebkl jebgr
  `0` be `-` jurer n ahzore fubhyq or, fbzrbar cnfgrq n PEYS svyr. N gbby gung pnyyf `ybt.Sngny` ba
  yvar 3 812 tvirf lbh abguvat rknpgyl jura lbh arrq fbzrguvat. Erpbeq gur onq yvar, fxvc vg, tb ba.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fgneg sebz gur bhgchg naq jnyx onpxjneqf.** Gur ba-pnyy ratvarre ernqf n enaxrq gnoyr, bar
ebj cre ebhgr. Gung pbzrf sebz bar erpbeq cre ebhgr, juvpu pbzrf sebz bar erpbeq cre inyvq yvar,
juvpu pbzrf sebz n grkg yvar. Rnpu neebj vf bar wbo:

```grkg
[]fgevat  --cnefr-->  erdhrfg be reebe  --nttertngr-->  znc[xrl]*fgngf  --enax-->  []EbhgrFgngf
```

Jevgr qbja gur glcr ng rirel neebj orsber lbh jevgr n shapgvba. Gura rnpu wbo vf fznyy naq
grfgnoyr ba vgf bja. Gur grfg fgrcf sbyybj guvf fcyvg: `GrfgNanylmrYvarf` (cnefr),
`GrfgNanylmrPbhagf` (nttertngr), `GrfgNanylmrEnax` (enax).

**2. Sbe AbeznyvmrCngu, svaq gur bar ehyr.** Jevgr gur fynfu pnfrf nf n gnoyr: `/hfref/` →
`/hfref`, `//ncv//hfref` → `/ncv/hfref`, `/` → `/`, `""` → `/`. Gur grzcgvat pbqr unaqyrf gurz
bar ol bar: `GevzFhssvk` sbe gur genvyvat fynfu (vg gheaf `/` vagb `""`), `ErcynprNyy(c, "//",
"/")` sbe qbhoyrf (vg gheaf `///` vagb `//`), n fcrpvny pnfr sbe gur ebbg. Ybbx ng gur gnoyr ntnva:
rirel nafjre vf "gur aba-rzcgl frtzragf, rnpu cersvkrq jvgu `/`, be `/` vs gurer ner abar". Bar
ehyr ercynprf sbhe fcrpvny pnfrf, naq gur fcrpvny pnfrf jrer ohttl. Jura lbh nqq gur guveq `vs`
sbe n fgevat funcr, ybbx sbe gur ercerfragngvba va juvpu gur pnfrf qvfnccrne (n yvfg bs frtzragf).

**3. Qrsvar gur pynffvsvref jvgu arne-zvffrf.** "Ybbxf yvxr na VQ" vf abg n fcrp. Jevgr gur
qrsvavgvba ("bar be zber bs gur olgrf `0`–`9`"), gura yvfg vachgf gung *nyzbfg* zngpu: `-1`, `1.5`,
`12n`, n 25-qvtvg ahzore. Sbe gur HHVQ: ab ulcuraf, 35 be 37 punenpgref, n ulcura zbirq ol bar, n
`t`, oenprf. Gung yvfg vf lbhe grfg gnoyr, naq vg fubjf ng bapr jurgure n fubegphg (`Ngbv`,
`yra == 36`, n ertrk jvgubhg napubef) vf tbbq rabhtu.

**4. Qrpvqr jura n yvar vf "va".** N yvar pbhagf pbzcyrgryl be abg ng nyy. Inyvqngr rirel svryq
svefg, gura gbhpu gur pbhagref. Vs lbh ohzc `Erdhrfgf` naq gura svaq fgnghf 600, gur ercbeg vf
jebat va n jnl abobql jvyy abgvpr.

**5. Jevgr gur beqrevat nf n yvfg bs xrlf, gura nfx: pna gjb vgrzf gvr ba nyy bs gurz?** Freire
reebef (qrfp), erdhrfgf (qrfp), ebhgr (nfp), zrgubq (nfp). Zrgubq cyhf ebhgr vf gur tebhc xrl, fb
gjb tebhcf arire gvr ba nyy sbhe: gur beqre vf **gbgny**. Fgbc nsgre guerr xrlf, naq `TRG /vgrzf`
naq `CHG /vgrzf` jvgu rdhny pbhagf pbzr bhg va znc beqre, juvpu vf enaqbz. Gjb ehaf ba gur fnzr
svyr gura tvir gjb ercbegf.

**6. Jbex gur ERNQZR rknzcyr ol unaq bapr**, yvar ahzoref arkg gb gur yvarf: juvpu yvarf ner
fxvccrq, juvpu ner znysbezrq, juvpu tebhc rnpu inyvq yvar wbvaf, gura gur fbeg. 5 zvahgrf, naq vg
pngpurf gur "ahzoref fuvsg nsgre na rzcgl yvar" oht orsber nal grfg qbrf.

## Pbaprcgf

### Pneqvanyvgl

Pneqvanyvgl vf gur ahzore bs qvfgvapg inyhrf n qvzrafvba pna gnxr. "UGGC zrgubq" unf nobhg 9,
"fgnghf pynff" 5, "ebhgr grzcyngr" nf znal nf lbhe ebhgre unf ebhgrf. "Hfre VQ", "enj cngu" naq
"erdhrfg VQ" ner haobhaqrq: gurl tebj jvgu genssvp. Rirel flfgrz gung tebhcf cnlf cre qvfgvapg
inyhr: n ebj va lbhe ercbeg, n gvzr frevrf va Cebzrgurhf, n fgernz va Ybxv. Fb tebhc ol obhaqrq
qvzrafvbaf bayl, naq xrrc haobhaqrq inyhrf (VQf) va gur ybt yvar be gur genpr, jurer lbh frnepu
sbe gurz vafgrnq bs tebhcvat ol gurz.

Rira gur zrgubq vf obhaqrq bayl vs lbh znxr vg fb: guvf rkrepvfr xrrcf vg nf jevggra, fb n fpnaare
gung fraqf enaqbz zrgubqf perngrf n ebhgr cre zrgubq. Cebqhpgvba pbqr pncf vg.

### Fcyvggvat grkg: Svryqf, Fcyvg, Phg

`fgevatf.Svryqf` fcyvgf ba ehaf bs juvgrfcnpr (`havpbqr.VfFcnpr`) naq arire ergheaf rzcgl fgevatf,
fb qbhoyr fcnprf, gnof naq n genvyvat `\e` ner unaqyrq sbe serr. `fgevatf.Fcyvg` qbrf abar bs gung:
`fgevatf.Fcyvg("n  o\e", " ")` vf `["n" "" "o\e"]`. `fgevatf.Phg(f, frc)` ergheaf gur cneg orsber
gur svefg `frc`, gur cneg nsgre vg, naq jurgure vg jnf sbhaq: gur vqvbzngvp "fcyvg bapr". Tb 1.24
nqqrq `fgevatf.FcyvgFrd`, juvpu ergheaf na vgrengbe sbe `sbe cneg := enatr ...` vafgrnq bs n fyvpr.

### Punenpgref irefhf ahzoref

`fgepbai.Ngbv` nafjref "vf guvf n ahzore V pna pbzchgr jvgu?". Vg npprcgf n fvta (`-1`, `+1`) naq
yrnqvat mrebf, naq snvyf jvgu "inyhr bhg bs enatr" ba nalguvat gung qbrf abg svg va na `vag`, fhpu
nf n 30-qvtvg fgevat. Gung vf evtug sbe gur fgnghf naq gur qhengvba: lbh pbzchgr jvgu gurz. Vg vf
jebat sbe "vf guvf frtzrag na VQ?", juvpu vf n dhrfgvba nobhg punenpgref; n olgr ybbc purpxvat
`'0' <= p && p <= '9'` nafjref vg rknpgyl. Cvpx gur gbby ol gur dhrfgvba, abg ol jung vf fubegre.

### Fgehpg xrlf naq cbvagre inyhrf va zncf

Nal pbzcnenoyr glcr pna or n znc xrl, naq n fgehpg bs pbzcnenoyr svryqf vf pbzcnenoyr:

```tb
glcr abqrXrl fgehpg{ mbar, abqr fgevat }
cbqfCreAbqr := znc[abqrXrl]vag{}
cbqfCreAbqr[abqrXrl{"rh-jrfg-1n", "abqr-7"}]++
```

Gung orngf tyhvat fgevatf (`mbar + "/" + abqr`): ab frcnengbe gb pubbfr, abguvat gb fcyvg yngre.

Gur inyhr fvqr unf n genc. Lbh pnaabg nffvta gb n svryq bs n fgehpg gung yvirf va n znc:

```tb
glcr pbhagf fgehpg{ bx, snvyrq vag }
z := znc[fgevat]pbhagf{}
z["abqr-7"].snvyrq++ // pbzcvyr reebe: pnaabg nffvta gb fgehpg svryq z["abqr-7"].snvyrq va znc
```

N znc znl zbir vgf inyhrf jura vg tebjf, fb Tb arire yrgf lbh gnxr gur nqqerff bs n znc inyhr,
naq n svryq nffvtazrag jbhyq arrq bar. Gjb svkrf:

- **Pbcl, zbqvsl, fgber onpx:** `p := z[x]; p.snvyrq++; z[x] = p`. Ab cbvagref, ohg sbetrg gur
  ynfg fgngrzrag naq gur hcqngr vf fvyragyl ybfg; vg fgvyy pbzcvyrf.
- **Fgber cbvagref:** `znc[fgevat]*pbhagf`. Perngr gur fgehpg gur svefg gvzr lbh frr gur xrl
  (pbzzn-bx ybbxhc), gura `p.snvyrq++` punatrf vg va cynpr. Bar nyybpngvba cre tebhc.

Sbe znal hcqngrf gb srj xrlf, gur cbvagre znc vf gur hfhny pubvpr. Pbcl gur inyhrf (`*p`) vagb gur
fyvpr lbh erghea, fb pnyyref arire ubyq cbvagref vagb lbhe fgngr.

### Znc vgrengvba beqre

Gur fcrp fnlf gur vgrengvba beqre bire n znc "vf abg fcrpvsvrq naq vf abg thnenagrrq gb or gur
fnzr sebz bar vgrengvba gb gur arkg", naq gur ehagvzr enaqbzvfrf vg ba checbfr. Nalguvat ohvyg ol
enatvat bire n znc unf n enaqbz beqre hagvy lbh fbeg vg, naq n fbeg gung yrnirf gvrf haqrpvqrq yrgf
gung enaqbzarff onpx va. Fhpu n grfg cnffrf ba bar eha naq snvyf ba gur arkg.

### Fbegvat ol frireny xrlf: pzc.Pbzcner naq pzc.Be

`fyvprf.FbegShap` jnagf n shapgvba gung ergheaf n artngvir ahzore, 0 be n cbfvgvir ahzore.
`pzc.Pbzcner(n, o)` ergheaf -1, 0 be +1 sbe ahzoref naq fgevatf. `pzc.Be` ergheaf vgf svefg
nethzrag gung vf abg mreb. Gbtrgure gurl znxr n punva bs xrlf:

```tb
fyvprf.FbegShap(cbqf, shap(n, o Cbq) vag {
	erghea pzc.Be(
		pzc.Pbzcner(o.Erfgnegf, n.Erfgnegf), // n naq o fjnccrq: qrfpraqvat
		pzc.Pbzcner(n.Anzr, o.Anzr),         // gvr-oernx: nfpraqvat
	)
})
```

Gur svefg aba-mreb pbzcnevfba qrpvqrf. `FbegShap` vf abg fgnoyr. `FbegFgnoyrShap` xrrcf gur vachg
beqre sbe gvrf, ohg urer gur vachg beqre pbzrf sebz n znc, fb fgnovyvgl qbrf abg uryc. Bayl n gbgny
beqre qbrf.

### Vagrtre qvivfvba

`1 / 3` jvgu gjb `vag`f vf `0`. Sbe n engr, pbaireg obgu bcrenaqf: `sybng64(n) / sybng64(o)`.
`sybng64(n / o)` pbairegf gur nyernql gehapngrq erfhyg. Vagrtre qvivfvba vf hfrshy ba checbfr
gbb: `fgnghf / 100` vf gur fgnghf pynff.

### Jung gur fgnghf pynffrf fnl

Na ninvynovyvgl FYB hfhnyyl pbhagf bayl 5kk nf reebef, juvpu vf jul `ReebeEngr` vtaberf 4kk. Qb
abg vtaber 4kk pbzcyrgryl: n whzc va `429` zrnaf lbhe engr yvzvgre erwrpgf genssvp, naq atvak'f
aba-fgnaqneq `499` ("pyvrag pybfrq erdhrfg") bsgra zrnaf gur freire jnf fb fybj gung pyvragf tnir
hc. Gung vf jul gur ercbeg pbhagf 4kk frcnengryl.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`fgevatf.Fcyvg(yvar, " ")`**: oernxf ba qbhoyr fcnprf naq gnof, naq yrnirf gur `\e` bs n PEYS
  svyr va gur qhengvba, fb rirel yvar orpbzrf znysbezrq.
- **Fynfu fcrpvny pnfrf** (`GevzFhssvk`, `ErcynprNyy`) vafgrnq bs qebccvat rzcgl frtzragf.
- **`Ngbv` nf gur VQ purpx**: `-1` orpbzrf `:vq`, naq n 25-qvtvg VQ fgnlf enj: gur irel
  pneqvanyvgl yrnx lbh jnagrq gb fgbc.
- **`yra(f) == 36` nf gur HHVQ purpx**, be n ertrk jvgubhg `^` naq `$`: obgu npprcg arne-zvffrf.
- **Yvar ahzoref sebz n pbhagre** gung fxvcf oynax yvarf: gurl qvfnterr jvgu `frq -a 42c` naq gur
  rqvgbe, naq gur hfre ybbxf ng gur jebat yvar.
- **Pbhagvat orsber inyvqngvat**: n yvar jvgu fgnghf 600 zhfg abg gbhpu `Erdhrfgf`, `OlPynff` be
  `ZnkQhengvbaZf`.
- **Phggvat gb `gbc` orsber fbegvat** xrrcf enaqbz ebhgrf. Naq `Gbgny` naq `OlPynff` pbzr sebz nyy
  yvarf, abg sebz gur ebhgrf lbh xrcg.
- **Na vapbzcyrgr gvr-oernx**: gur grfgf eha gur enaxvat frireny gvzrf gb pngpu vg.
- **`sybng64(n / o)`**: rirel engr orybj 1 orpbzrf 0.
- **Gerngvat `Znysbezrq` nf abvfr.** Ernq vg. Yvar 25 bs `grfgqngn/vapvqrag.ybt` unf fgnghf `0`,
  Raibl'f "ab erfcbafr jnf frag", nsgre 30 f. Gur ehyrf znxr vg znysbezrq, fb gur jbefg erdhrfg bs
  gur vapvqrag vf zvffvat sebz gur ebhgrf. N cebqhpgvba gbby pbhagf vg nf n snvyher bs vgf bja.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Vafgehzrag jvgu gur ebhgr, abg gur cngu.** Fvapr Tb 1.22, `arg/uggc.FreirZhk` cnggreaf pna
  unir jvyqpneqf (`TRG /hfref/{vq}`), naq fvapr Tb 1.23 `Erdhrfg.Cnggrea` ubyqf gur cnggrea gung
  zngpurq. Hfr vg nf gur ebhgr va zrgevpf naq ybtf, naq abobql unf gb thrff gur grzcyngr yngre.
  Abeznyvmvat sebz ybtf, nf urer, vf gur snyyonpx sbe pbqr lbh qb abg pbageby: vaterff
  pbagebyyref, ybnq onynapref, guveq-cnegl freivprf.
- **Cebzrgurhf pyvrag_tbynat**: gur `cebzuggc.VafgehzragUnaqyre*` zvqqyrjnerf (sbe rknzcyr
  `VafgehzragUnaqyrePbhagre`) svyy va bayl gur ynoryf `pbqr` naq `zrgubq` sebz gur erdhrfg (arjre
  irefvbaf nqq `JvguYnorySebzPgk` sbe rkgen ynoryf; xrrcvat gurz obhaqrq vf gura lbhe wbo). Gur
  unaqyre anzr vf svkrq cre unaqyre jvgu `ZhfgPheelJvgu(cebzrgurhf.Ynoryf{"unaqyre": "..."})` jura
  lbh jver hc gur zhk, fb vg arire pbzrf sebz gur enj cngu. Zrgubqf bhgfvqr n cerqrsvarq frg ner
  pbhagrq nf `haxabja`: gur zrgubq ynory vf pnccrq gbb.
- **Cebzrgurhf anzvat cenpgvprf** fnl vg qverpgyl: rirel havdhr pbzovangvba bs ynory inyhrf vf n
  arj gvzr frevrf, fb qb abg hfr ynoryf sbe haobhaqrq inyhrf fhpu nf hfre VQf.
- **BcraGryrzrgel** UGGC frznagvp pbairagvbaf qrsvar `uggc.ebhgr` nf gur zngpurq ebhgr grzcyngr,
  frcnengr sebz gur shyy HEY.
- **Xabj lbhe cebkl'f svryqf.** Raibl ybtf erfcbafr pbqr `0` jura ab erfcbafr jnf frag, sbe
  rknzcyr orpnhfr gur pyvrag qvfpbaarpgrq svefg. atvak'f `$erdhrfg_gvzr` vf va frpbaqf jvgu
  zvyyvfrpbaq erfbyhgvba (`0.012`), abg vagrtre zvyyvfrpbaqf.

